>
  <header class="py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20 bg-secondary/30">
    <div class="container-article text-center">
      <h1 class="text-balance">Best Office Chair for Someone Who Is 6'7" or Taller</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg md:text-xl text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto animate-slide-up">
        An honest fit assessment: which chairs come closest, where they fall short, and what to do when mainstream options aren't enough
